<view class="container"><view class="card dmv-head"><view class="title">纽约州 DMV 中文题库</view><view class="dmv-sub">共 {{count}} 道练习题 · 版本 {{version}}</view></view><button class="btn start" bindtap="openPractice">开始全部题目练习</button><view class="section-title">按知识点练习</view><view class="card"><view class="item" wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="key" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="openCategory"><view class="row"><view class="item-title">{{item.label}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.count}} 题 →</view></view></view></view><view class="muted note">题库仅供学习，非官方正式考题。</view></view>
